 "comment": "SymbTr file name makam--form--usul--title--composer -> cards. Spec 2026-10-27-melody-trained-design (makam families). Folk forms with a known place (the composer field of a türkü is its region) go to the regional card + the form's card; other pieces go to their makam family's cards (+ the form's card). Degrees are taken in the TARGET card's scale (nearest comma), so a family only goes to cards whose scale fits it. Hand-set judgements; tune by ear.",
